# Inside a Pokémon Gym (the original's SEQ_GYM role, the same in every Gym): you have come to be tested. A confident,
# driving E-flat major march: a bright trumpet tune over off-beat brass stabs and a bass pumping in octaves, then a
# stricter middle where the trumpet calls, the horn answers and the snare drives like a drill, and a climb of brass hits
# up through C-flat and D-flat back home. Indoors, so one arrangement by day and by night. Original composition for
# this game.
title Pokémon Gym
tempo 138
meter 4/4
reverb 0.22
night none

